@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@regionAdminAccessToken =
@otherRegionAdminAccessToken =
@pendingContentId = 920002
@rejectContentId = 920001
@publishedContentId = 900001
@revisionId = 920001
@rejectRevisionId = 920002
@pendingSessionId = 920011
@rejectSessionId = 920012
@sessionRevisionId = 920001
@rejectSessionRevisionId = 920002
@suspendContentId = 920003
@deleteContentId = 920002
@endContentId = 920006
@notPublishedContentId = 920004

# P0 지역 관리자 콘텐츠 심사/운영 상태 변경
# 선행 조건: 담당 region의 REGION_ADMIN 토큰, PENDING 콘텐츠, EDIT_REQUESTED 수정본이 필요하다.

### 1. 대기 콘텐츠 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. 잘못된 status 필터 - 400 INVALID_INPUT 기대
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents?status=UNKNOWN
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. 콘텐츠 심사 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{pendingContentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. 타 지역 관리자 콘텐츠 상세 조회 - 403 FORBIDDEN 기대
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{pendingContentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{otherRegionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. 콘텐츠 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{pendingContentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. 콘텐츠 승인 반복 - 기존 승인 결과 또는 409 CONTENT_STATE_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{pendingContentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. 콘텐츠 반려 - 다른 PENDING 콘텐츠 ID로 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{rejectContentId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "필수 안내 문구 보완 필요"
}

### 8. 콘텐츠 반려 사유 공백 - 400 INVALID_INPUT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{rejectContentId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": " "
}

### 9. 수정본 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/content-revisions?status=EDIT_REQUESTED
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. 수정본 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/content-revisions/{{revisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. 수정본 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/content-revisions/{{revisionId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. 수정본 반려 - 다른 EDIT_REQUESTED 수정본 ID로 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/content-revisions/{{rejectRevisionId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "수정 내용 보완 필요"
}

### 13. 회차 대기 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/sessions?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. 회차 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/sessions/{{pendingSessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. 회차 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/sessions/{{pendingSessionId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 16. 회차 반려 - 다른 PENDING 회차 ID로 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/sessions/{{rejectSessionId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "회차 시간 보완 필요"
}

### 17. 회차 수정 요청 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/session-revisions?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 18. 회차 수정 요청 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/session-revisions/{{sessionRevisionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 19. 회차 수정 요청 승인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/session-revisions/{{sessionRevisionId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. 회차 수정 요청 반려 - 다른 PENDING 회차 수정 요청 ID로 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/session-revisions/{{rejectSessionRevisionId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "정원 변경 근거 보완 필요"
}

### 21. 운영 중단 - PUBLISHED 콘텐츠에서 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{suspendContentId}}/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "운영 정책 위반"
}

### 22. PUBLISHED가 아닌 콘텐츠 운영 중단 - 409 CONTENT_SUSPEND_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{notPublishedContentId}}/suspend
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "상태 오류 검증"
}

### 23. 콘텐츠 삭제 - 삭제 가능한 상태 콘텐츠에서 200 OK 기대
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{deleteContentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "reason": "관리자 삭제"
}

### 24. 콘텐츠 종료 - PUBLISHED 콘텐츠에서 실행
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{endContentId}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 25. PUBLISHED가 아닌 콘텐츠 종료 - 409 CONTENT_END_CONFLICT 기대
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{notPublishedContentId}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 26. 이력 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/region-admin/contents/{{publishedContentId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{regionAdminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

